,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/pendant_light_guid.jpg","background_color":"","video_options":"local","video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc","link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/kitchen-lights-for-over-table","color":"default","content_spacing":"default","text_size":"medium","h_text_weight":400,"title":"","subtext":"","content":"","button_type":"primary","btn_content":"","open_link":"_blank"}}},"block_order":["image_banner_7Jpw4c"],"settings":{"show_heading_header":false,"heading":"Title","description":"","text_alignment":"text-center","container":"container","banner_background_color":"","hover_effect":"zoom","design_banner":"text-overlay-image","text_position":"top","text_align":"text-left","content_on_mobile":false,"column_gap":30,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_liquid_U4pApF":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"heading":"Why Lighting Matters?","description":"","text_alignment":"text-left","container":"container","background_color":"","content_liquid":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_text_RUtjjR":{"type":"custom-text","blocks":{"desc_J6rtAn":{"type":"desc","settings":{"desc":"<p>Poor lighting isn't just about aesthetics – it can affect everything from your mood to your productivity. Many people struggle with harsh overhead lights that create an uninviting atmosphere, or insufficient lighting that makes daily tasks difficult. The good news? Creating the<a href=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/\"> perfect lighting<\/a> scheme is both achievable and affordable, regardless of your living situation.<\/p>","desc_color":"","desc_fs":16,"desc_fw":200,"content_width":100,"desc_tf":"unset","desc_mt":0,"desc_mb":0}}},"block_order":["desc_J6rtAn"],"settings":{"container":"container","text_align":"text-left","bg_color":"","custom_class":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_html_6Ew7Bg":{"type":"custom-html","disabled":true,"name":"Custom HTML","settings":{"heading":"Custom HTML","description":"","text_alignment":"text-center","container":"container","background_color":"","content_html":"<div style=\"margin: 32px 0;\">\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n        <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; width: 30%;\">Feature<\/th>\n        <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\">Why it matters<\/th>\n      <\/tr>\n    <\/thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Adjustable cable\/chain length<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Fits different ceiling heights without professional shortening<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Multi-outlet \/ spider fittings<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">One ceiling point, multiple bulbs — good for wide islands or open-plan spaces<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">E27 fitting<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Compatible with the widest range of LED bulb shapes and colour temperatures<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Dimmable-compatible options<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Pairs with dimmer switches for adjustable ambience<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; vertical-align: top;\">IP-rated options<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; vertical-align: top;\">Where available, safe for bathrooms or covered outdoor use<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n    <\/tbody>\n  <\/table>\n<\/div>","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_liquid_KeeLkN":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"heading":"Understanding Your Lighting Needs","description":"","text_alignment":"text-left","container":"container","background_color":"","content_liquid":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_text_CmcrEN":{"type":"custom-text","blocks":{"desc_m6WqzN":{"type":"desc","settings":{"desc":"<p>Before diving into specific solutions, consider the three main types of lighting every space needs:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Ambient Lighting:<\/strong> This provides overall illumination and usually comes from <a href=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/ceiling-lights-for-flash-lights\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Ceiling light \">ceiling fixtures<\/a>. Whether you're considering sleek<a href=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/kitchen-lights-for-over-table\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"black pendant light\"> black ceiling lights for your kitchen<\/a> or contemporary <a href=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/living-or-dining-room-lighting\" title=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/living-or-dining-room-lighting\">pendant lighting for your living room<\/a>, the key is choosing fixtures that complement your space while providing adequate brightness.<\/li><li><strong>Task Lighting: <\/strong>Essential for specific activities like reading, cooking, or working. Think under-cabinet lights in the kitchen or<a href=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/table-lamps\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"table lamp\"> adjustable desk lamps<\/a> in your home office.<\/li><li><strong>Accent Lighting: <\/strong>The secret weapon of cozy spaces. Use <a href=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/pendant-lights?page=39\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"pendant lighting\">pendant lamps<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/collections\/wall-light\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"new wall light\">wall sconces<\/a>, or strategically placed table lamps to create atmosphere and highlight architectural features.<\/li><\/ul>","desc_color":"","desc_fs":16,"desc_fw":400,"content_width":100,"desc_tf":"unset","desc_mt":0,"desc_mb":0}}},"block_order":["desc_m6WqzN"],"settings":{"container":"container","text_align":"text-left","bg_color":"","custom_class":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_html_xWCk7y":{"type":"custom-html","name":"Custom HTML","settings":{"heading":"Materials & Special Features","description":"","text_alignment":"text-center","container":"container","background_color":"","content_html":"<div style=\"margin: 32px 0;\">\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n        <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; width: 30%;\">Material<\/th>\n        <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\">What it offers<\/th>\n      <\/tr>\n    <\/thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">\n<strong>Metal<\/strong> (matte black, brass, copper, chrome finishes)<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Durable, industrial or contemporary look, widely available across the range<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Glass<\/strong><\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Diffuses light softly, works well as a statement piece over dining tables<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Hemp rope \/ rattan-style<\/strong><\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Warm, textured, suits rustic or Scandi interiors<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fabric-wrapped cable<\/strong><\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; vertical-align: top;\">A styling detail as much as a material — lets you colour-match cord to décor<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n    <\/tbody>\n  <\/table>\n<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 32px 0;\">\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n        <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; width: 30%;\">Feature<\/th>\n        <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\">Why it matters<\/th>\n      <\/tr>\n    <\/thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Adjustable cable\/chain length<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Fits different ceiling heights without professional shortening<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Multi-outlet \/ spider fittings<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">One ceiling point, multiple bulbs — good for wide islands or open-plan spaces<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">E27 fitting<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Compatible with the widest range of LED bulb shapes and colour temperatures<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Dimmable-compatible options<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; vertical-align: top;\">Pairs with dimmer switches for adjustable ambience<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; vertical-align: top;\">IP-rated options<\/td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px; vertical-align: top;\">Where available, safe for bathrooms or covered outdoor use<\/td>\n      <\/tr>\n    <\/tbody>\n  <\/table>\n<\/div>","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"gallery_exLdca":{"type":"gallery","blocks":{"image_Lx7dcf":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Accent_Light.webp","link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/products\/industrial-retro-loft-glass-3way-ceiling-lamp-shade-pendant-light-5607"}},"image_EkN3gh":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/versatile_light.webp","link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/products\/3-way-industrial-conduit-pipe-ceiling-pendant-diy-light-fixture"}},"image_xY7mTh":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/black_ceiling_light.webp","link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/products\/industrial-conduit-pipe-plug-in-wall-light-kit-e27-lamp-wall-mounted-5687"}},"image_dixmRf":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/task_lighting.webp","link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/products\/industrial-vintage-modern-metal-retro-e27-ceiling-red-barn-slotted-pendant-shade"}},"image_UezecW":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/LENIER_LIGHTING_4269350a-4d6d-4d5b-9b97-daf0f7d0fc02.webp","link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/products\/modern-linear-pendant-lighting-with-rectangle-clear-crystal-shade-5051"}},"image_LD7Gkh":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Accent_Lighting.webp","link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/products\/turkish-mosaic-tiles-glass-pendant-light-fixture-globe-shape-4910"}}},"block_order":["image_Lx7dcf","image_EkN3gh","image_xY7mTh","image_dixmRf","image_UezecW","image_LD7Gkh"],"settings":{"heading":"","description":"","text_align":"text-center","container":"container","background_color":"","layout_type":"carousel","column_gap":30,"aspect_ratio":"original","custom_ratio":"21:9","actions_click":"unset","custom_column":3,"grid_image_desktop":4,"autoplay":false,"loop":false,"show_arrow":false,"show_bullet":true,"show_bullet_mobile":false,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_liquid_cW9ygK":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"heading":"How low should pendant lights hang?","description":"","text_alignment":"text-left","container":"container","background_color":"","content_liquid":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"custom_html_tpAxE8":{"type":"custom-html","settings":{"heading":"","description":"","text_alignment":"text-center","container":"container","background_color":"","content_html":"<style>\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n        th, td {\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\n            padding: 12px;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n        th {\n            background-color: #f2f2f2;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        tr:nth-child(even) {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n        tr:hover {\n            background-color: #f5f5f5;\n        }\n    <\/style>\n    <table>\n        <tbody>\n<tr>\n            <th>Location<\/th>\n            <th>Recommended Height Above Surface<\/th>\n            <th>Additional Considerations<\/th>\n        <\/tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Living Room<\/td>\n            <td>5 to 7 feet above seating<\/td>\n            <td>Aim for at least 7 feet of space between the floor and whatever you're hanging.  You can go higher or lower depending on how tall your ceiling is and what looks best to you.<\/td>\n        <\/tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Dining Room<\/td>\n            <td>28 to 32 inches above the table<\/td>\n            <td>To figure out the best height to hang a light fixture:\n\nIf your ceiling is higher than 8 feet, for every extra foot, add 3 inches to the fixture's height.\nThe bottom of the light should be about 75 to 85 centimeters (roughly 2.5 to 2.8 feet) above the table.\nMake sure the light isn't in the way when people are trying to see across the table.<\/td>\n        <\/tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Kitchen Island<\/td>\n            <td>30 to 36 inches above the countertop<\/td>\n            <td>Another source suggests 2.5 to 3 feet (70-90cm) above the counter. There should be a minimum of 7 feet from the floor to the bottom of the pendant. Consider the size of the pendants and the overall scale of the island when determining placement.<\/td>\n        <\/tr>\n    <\/tbody>\n<\/table>","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"faq_ACUEPk":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"faq_nwkEmT":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"How many pendant lights do I need over a kitchen island?","content":"<p>As a rule of thumb, allow one pendant for every 75–90cm of island length, spaced evenly so the light spreads without leaving dark patches at either end. A 1.8m island typically suits two to three pendants; anything longer usually looks better as a cluster or linear bar fitting.<\/p>"}},"faq_Lk3KWb":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Can I adjust the drop length of a pendant light?","content":"<p>Most of our pendants come with an adjustable cable or chain, so you can set the drop to suit your ceiling height without cutting anything. If a listing doesn't mention adjustable length, the product page will state the fixed drop measurement — check this against the table above before ordering.<\/p>"}},"faq_C68cAf":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Are LEDSone pendant lights dimmable?","content":"<p>Many of our fittings are dimmer-compatible when paired with a dimmable LED bulb and a compatible dimmer switch. Look for \"dimmable\" in the product title or spec table; if it isn't listed, treat the fitting as non-dimmable to avoid flickering.<\/p>"}},"faq_Wq3N4P":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Do I need an electrician to install a pendant light?","content":"<p>Swapping a like-for-like pendant on an existing ceiling rose is a job many confident DIYers manage safely, but any new wiring, ceiling rose relocation, or work near a consumer unit should go to a qualified electrician. When in doubt, get a professional to check the installation.<\/p>"}},"faq_Yhkcp3":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"What bulb fitting do LEDSone pendant lights use?","content":"<p>The vast majority of our pendant range uses an E27 (screw) fitting, which is noted on each product page along with maximum wattage. Always check the individual listing, as a small number of styles use different fittings.<\/p>"}},"faq_Yfcgdw":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Can pendant lights be used outdoors or in bathrooms?","content":"<p>Only fittings with an appropriate IP rating are safe for bathrooms or covered outdoor spaces. Check the IP rating on the product page — standard indoor pendants without an IP rating should stay in dry, living areas only.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq_nwkEmT","faq_Lk3KWb","faq_C68cAf","faq_Wq3N4P","faq_Yhkcp3","faq_Yfcgdw"],"custom_css":[],"name":"Faq","settings":{"heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","description":"","text_alignment":"text-center","container":"container","background_color":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"banner_with_text_McfLaN":{"type":"banner-with-text","blocks":{"heading_dng4VB":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Looking to transform your home with stylish lighting?","heading_color":"#111111","heading_fs":40,"heading_fw":500,"heading_tf":"unset","heading_mt":0,"heading_mb":10}},"text_LbEDLK":{"type":"text","settings":{"txt_content":"<p><br\/>Learn all about pendant lights, their types, and why designers love them.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","txt_color":"","txt_fs":16,"txt_fw":400,"txt_tf":"unset","txt_mt":0,"txt_mb":25}},"buttons_3Rx6H8":{"type":"buttons","settings":{"btn_content":"Read More →","button_type":"primary","button_link":"https:\/\/ledsone.co.uk\/pages\/hanging-lights","button_target":false,"b_mt":0,"b_mb":15}}},"block_order":["heading_dng4VB","text_LbEDLK","buttons_3Rx6H8"],"name":"Banner with text","settings":{"container":"container","background_color":"","banner_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/pendant_lighting_modern.jpg","video_options":"local","video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc","link":"","hover_effect":"zoom","bn_design":"text_column","banner_height":"depend-image","height_dk":800,"height_tb":600,"height_mb":360,"content_box":"content_in_container","text_bellow_mobile":false,"img_position":"left","banner_width":"col-md-6","column_gap":30,"text_horizontal_position":"left","text_position":"center","text_align":"text-center","content_width":100,"content_bg_color":"","bg_opacity":100,"eb_scrolling":false,"s_text_color":"#111111","s_text_font_size":80,"s_text_font_weight":600,"text_time":10,"text_spacing":50,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}}},"order":["38f3b02d-4d55-4285-bac3-806855394e6d","main-collection-heading","custom_html_EigtzR","8498460c-0376-40d1-bafc-199edbe0edfc","439e38df-206c-40a8-9cd5-fc0e5f00f9d3","custom_html_Eh7Kck","product-grid","custom_liquid_z46zMY","custom_text_PYCWrA","custom_text_yX6rkx","banner_image_jQGMQz","custom_liquid_U4pApF","custom_text_RUtjjR","custom_html_6Ew7Bg","custom_liquid_KeeLkN","custom_text_CmcrEN","custom_html_xWCk7y","gallery_exLdca","custom_liquid_cW9ygK","custom_html_tpAxE8","faq_ACUEPk","banner_with_text_McfLaN"]}